      "text": "London's Pearly Kings began with a sweeper.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "hook"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The Pearly Kings and Queens grew out of London's street market traders.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "real",
        "src": "616-london-s-pearly-kings-began-with-a-sweeper-0.jpg",
        "fit": "card",
        "label": "A Pearly King and Queen mosaic",
        "credit": "Photo: Matt Brown, CC BY 2.0"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "They sewed buttons onto their clothes, in brass or pearl.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "piece",
        "piece": "stone",
        "stone": "tanzanite",
        "metal": "yellow",
        "label": "Sewn on buttons",
        "cut": "oval"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Henry Croft was an orphan who worked as a street sweeper.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "title",
        "text": "Henry Croft",
        "sub": "A sweeper",
        "piece": "ring",
        "stone": "sapphire",
        "metal": "platinum",
        "cut": "oval"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "He is thought to have been the first pearly king.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "piece",
        "piece": "ring",
        "stone": "peridot",
        "metal": "platinum",
        "label": "The first king",
        "cut": "cushion"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "He covered a whole suit in pearl buttons.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "real",
        "src": "616-london-s-pearly-kings-began-with-a-sweeper-1.jpg",
        "fit": "card",
        "label": "Pearl buttons",
        "credit": "Public domain, via Wikimedia Commons"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "He stood out in the crowd while raising money for charity.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "piece",
        "piece": "brooch",
        "stone": "ruby",
        "metal": "platinum",
        "label": "For charity",
        "cut": "round",
        "petals": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The money went to orphanages and hospitals.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "piece",
        "piece": "ring",
        "stone": "sapphire",
        "metal": "yellow",
        "label": "Orphanages",
        "cut": "oval"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Other traders copied him, and each borough got a pearly family.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "piece",
        "piece": "necklace",
        "stone": "ruby",
        "metal": "platinum",
        "label": "Copied everywhere",
        "cut": "pear"
